# Globs, so Vite Task can prefix each line with `!`.
# A trailing `/**` keeps Oxlint `--ignore-path .gitignore` aligned with Git for explicitly passed paths (`site/` alone does not).
# A leading `**/` matches in every directory.
**/node_modules/**
site/**
**/storybook-static/**
**/.sonda/**
.vite/**
coverage/**
**/*.tsbuildinfo
